      <div style="font-size: 1.02rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #cbd5e1;"><h3>Initiating the Booking and Documentation</h3>
The journey begins with a seamless digital booking process on our platform, where you schedule your <strong>car transport from Pune to Chandigarh</strong>. After you provide the vehicle’s registration details, current condition, and preferred delivery window, our logistics team confirms the route and finalizes the quote. You receive a digital proforma invoice and a pre-transit checklist, ensuring all necessary documents—such as the RC copy and insurance certificate—are ready. This initial stage guarantees transparency and sets clear expectations for both the shipper and the carrier.

<h3>Joint Inspection and Handover</h3>
Before the vehicle moves, a rigorous joint inspection takes place at the Pune pickup point. Our certified pickup agents and the vehicle owner conduct a 360-degree assessment, documenting any existing scratches, dents, or mechanical issues through high-resolution photos and a detailed condition report. Both parties sign the digital check-in sheet, creating a legally binding record of the car’s state. This step eliminates post-delivery disputes and ensures accountability from the moment the wheels start turning.

<h3>Secure Loading onto the Transport Carrier</h3>
Once inspection is complete, the vehicle is driven onto the enclosed transport trailer using a hydraulic ramp. Skilled ramp operators guide the car to its designated bay, where it is secured with heavy-duty ratchet straps and wheel chocks. For added protection, we install soft foam padding around the bumpers and mirrors. Enclosed trailers shield the vehicle from weather elements, road debris, and theft, making this method ideal for long-distance routes spanning over 1,200 kilometers. The driver then locks the trailer and verifies that all safety latches are engaged before departure.

<h3>Real-Time Transit Monitoring</h3>
During the multi-day transit, our GPS-enabled tracking system provides live location updates every 15 minutes. You can access the vehicle’s status via a dedicated mobile app or SMS alerts, ensuring complete visibility. The driver follows a pre-planned route through key waypoints, including Nagpur and Bhopal, while adhering to strict speed limits and rest schedules. Our operations team monitors fuel levels, tire pressure, and route deviations in real time, proactively addressing any logistical challenges before they impact the delivery timeline.

