      <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.35; margin-bottom: 18px;">Essential RTO Documentation &amp; Statutory Checklist for Pune‑Chandigarh Vehicle Move</h2>
      <div style="font-size: 1.02rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #cbd5e1;"><div style="background: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.08); border-left: 4px solid #f59e0b; border-radius: 0 10px 10px 0; padding: 18px 22px; margin: 24px 0;"><h4 style="color: #f59e0b; font-size: 1.05rem; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 6px 0;"><i class="fas fa-exclamation-triangle" style="margin-right: 8px;"></i>Important Logistics Advisory</h4><div style="color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 0.92rem; margin: 0; line-height: 1.6;"><strong>⚠️ Warning: Moving a vehicle from Pune to Chandigarh without proper RTO documentation, insurance, e‑Way bill, and government approvals can lead to hefty fines, impoundment, or legal complications.</strong></div></div>

<h3>Key RTO Documentation Checklist</h3>
<div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(230px, 1fr)); gap: 20px; margin-top: 24px;">
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;">
    <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 10px; background: #f59e0b22; color: #f59e0b; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 14px;">01</div>
    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Vehicle Registration Certificate (RC) &amp; DDL:</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Verify that the RC is current and the Driver's Driving License (DDL) is valid. If the vehicle is newly purchased, ensure the RC has been transferred to the new owner’s name before departure.</p>
  </div>
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;">
    <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 10px; background: #10b98122; color: #10b981; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 14px;">02</div>
    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Insurance Policy:</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Update the insurance policy to reflect the new state (Punjab). A valid policy covering both Pune and Chandigarh zones is mandatory. Keep the insurance certificate handy for inspection.</p>
  </div>
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;">
    <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 10px; background: #3b82f622; color: #3b82f6; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 14px;">03</div>
    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">e‑Way Bill (e‑WB):</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">For inter‑state transport, generate an e‑Way Bill via the Ministry of Road Transport &amp; Highways portal. Include vehicle details, purpose of travel, and destination. The e‑WB must be printed and carried in the vehicle.</p>
  </div>
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;">
    <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 10px; background: #a855f722; color: #a855f7; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 14px;">04</div>
    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Government Approvals:</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">If the vehicle is commercial or a two‑wheelers used for hire, obtain a temporary permit from the Maharashtra RTO and a transit permit from the Punjab RTO. For heavy vehicles, a special permit from the State Transport Authority (STA) may be required.</p>
  </div>
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;">
    <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 10px; background: #ec489922; color: #ec4899; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 14px;">05</div>
    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Pollution Under Control (PUC) Certificate:</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Ensure the PUC is valid for at least 30 days beyond the travel date. An expired PUC can result in fines and vehicle immobilization.</p>
  </div>
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;">
    <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 10px; background: #06b6d422; color: #06b6d4; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 14px;">06</div>
    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Roadworthiness Certificate:</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">For commercial vehicles, a recent roadworthiness certificate is essential. Non‑compliance may trigger a stop‑and‑inspect order.</p>
  </div>
</div>

<h3>Actionable Steps Before Departure</h3>
<ul>
  <li>Confirm the RC and DDL are up to date; if transferring ownership, complete the process at the Pune RTO.</li>
  <li>Contact your insurance provider to update the policy for Punjab coverage and obtain an updated certificate.</li>
  <li>Generate and print the e‑Way Bill; keep a digital copy on your phone.</li>
  <li>Apply for temporary and transit permits through the respective RTO portals; track approval status.</li>
  <li>Renew the PUC and obtain a roadworthiness certificate if applicable.</li>
  <li>Pack all documents in a dedicated folder; carry both physical copies and digital backups.</li>
</ul>

<p>Follow this <strong>RTO documentation</strong> checklist meticulously to ensure a smooth, legal, and hassle‑free relocation of your vehicle from Pune to Chandigarh.</p></div>
