      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What is the typical transit time for car transport from Pune to Chandigarh?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Under normal traffic and weather conditions, Shree Ashirwad moves a vehicle from Pune to Chandigarh in approximately 30‑35 hours of road time. The route follows well‑maintained national highways and multi‑axle freight corridors, allowing continuous travel with scheduled driver rests. Real‑time GPS tracking ensures any delays are communicated instantly, so customers always know the expected arrival window for their car transport from Pune to Chandigarh.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How does Shree Ashirwad ensure zero scratches during the Pune‑to‑Chandigarh move?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Zero‑scratch assurance is achieved through a four‑step safety protocol: a joint pre‑loading inspection, loading on a hydraulic ramp with soft‑rubber rollers, securing the vehicle with a 4‑wheel lock system, and wrapping vulnerable edges with high‑density foam padding. Each step is documented and monitored by live CCTV, guaranteeing that the car transport from Pune to Chandigarh arrives in pristine condition.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What documents are required for RTO compliance when shifting a car from Pune to Chandigarh?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">For a legally compliant car transport from Pune to Chandigarh, you must provide the original registration certificate, a valid insurance policy, a signed transport agreement, the e‑Way bill generated for the interstate movement, and a copy of the owner’s ID proof. Additionally, the driver’s licence and vehicle fitness certificate are kept on board. Shree Ashirwad verifies each document before dispatch to avoid any statutory hiccups.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I track my vehicle in real time during the Pune‑to‑Chandigarh journey?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes. Every container carrier used for car transport from Pune to Chandigarh is equipped with satellite‑linked GPS devices that feed live location data to a secure portal. Customers receive a unique tracking link via SMS and email, allowing them to monitor the exact position, speed, and estimated arrival time of their vehicle 24/7, with automatic alerts for any route deviations.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How is the insurance coverage structured for car transport from Pune to Chandigarh?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Shree Ashirwad offers IRDAI‑approved marine transit insurance covering 100 % of the declared value of your vehicle. The policy protects against accidental damage, theft, and natural calamities throughout the Pune‑to‑Chandigarh transit. Customers can declare the exact market value during booking, and a detailed insurance certificate is provided before loading, ensuring full peace of mind for the entire journey.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Is there a price difference between using a container carrier versus an open trailer for this route?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes, a fully enclosed container carrier typically costs 10‑15 % more than an open trailer for car transport from Pune to Chandigarh because it offers superior protection against weather, road debris, and potential vandalism. However, the added security eliminates the risk of external damage, which many customers consider worth the premium. Shree Ashirwad provides transparent cost tables for both options so you can choose based on budget and safety preferences.</p>
      </div>
