ery container carrier used for car transport from Pune to Chandigarh is equipped with satellite‑linked GPS devices that feed live location data to a secure portal. Customers receive a unique tracking link via SMS and email, allowing them to monitor the exact position, speed, and estimated arrival time of their vehicle 24/7, with automatic alerts for any route deviations."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How is the insurance coverage structured for car transport from Pune to Chandigarh?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Shree Ashirwad offers IRDAI‑approved marine transit insurance covering 100 % of the declared value of your vehicle. The policy protects against accidental damage, theft, and natural calamities throughout the Pune‑to‑Chandigarh transit. Customers can declare the exact market value during booking, and a detailed insurance certificate is provided before loading, ensuring full peace of mind for the entire journey."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is there a price difference between using a container carrier versus an open trailer for this route?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes, a fully enclosed container carrier typically costs 10‑15 % more than an open trailer for car transport from Pune to Chandigarh because it offers superior protection against weather, road debris, and potential vandalism. However, the added security eliminates the risk of external damage, which many customers consider worth the premium. Shree Ashirwad provides transparent cost tables for both options so you can choose based on budget and safety preferences."}}]}
